1
00:00:00,725 --> 00:00:02,815
- You're over-thinking this.
- No, I'm not.

2
00:00:02,978 --> 00:00:06,478
(Penny:)- You always over-think things.
- There you go. "Always" made it worse.

3
00:00:08,066 --> 00:00:11,026
(Penny:)See, this is where everything
goes wrong, when we talk.

4
00:00:11,987 --> 00:00:15,277
(Leonard:)Well, I don't know how you have
a relationship without talking.

5
00:00:15,448 --> 00:00:18,158
I went out with T.J. for eight months.
We never talked.

6
00:00:18,326 --> 00:00:20,996
(Penny:)To this day, I don't even know
what T.J. stands for.

7
00:00:22,330 --> 00:00:26,420
Wait, if you guys didn't talk?...
Never mind, stupid question.

8
00:00:28,795 --> 00:00:32,635
(Sheldon:)And now that I have some wood...

9
00:00:33,550 --> 00:00:37,970
(Sheldon:)...I'm going to begin the erection
of my settlement.

10
00:00:39,014 --> 00:00:41,854
(Raj:)He's got to be doing this on purpose.

11
00:00:44,185 --> 00:00:48,985
Ooh, eight-thirty. You and Penny decide
to go out and paint the town beige?

12
00:00:50,317 --> 00:00:53,237
You're 30 years old
and you live with your mother.

13
00:00:55,572 --> 00:00:56,862
(Raj:)I guess it didn't go well.

14
00:00:57,032 --> 00:00:59,452
(Sheldon:)We don't know that. Not to a certainty.

